    "fact": "At 1.1.29 the CLI headless session config still binds the package constant 1000 (`maxTurns:this.config.maxTurns??<1e3>`) and the CLI `--max-turns` value is written only to Config.maxSessionTurns for the text error formatter. At 1.1.30 the CLI headless session config binds the value forwarded from argv, the drive-query expression loses its fixed fallback, and `--max-turns` gains a numeric argParser.",
